{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018o6HdDJhKf8KT8QC3qYYzP","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Leo Mears Tack Garcia de la Banda \"Globalizing constraint models\" CP 2013 pdf\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Globalizing Constraint Models - Monash\",\"url\":\"https://researchmgt.monash.edu/ws/files/444967109/352525004_oa.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Globalizing Constraint Models\",\"url\":\"http://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007%2F978-3-642-40627-0_34.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Globalizing constraint models - Monash University\",\"url\":\"https://research.monash.edu/en/publications/globalizing-constraint-models/\"},{\"title\":\"ModelSeeker: Extracting Global Constraint Models from Positive Examples\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-50137-6_4\"},{\"title\":\"Automated Auxiliary Variable Elimination Through On-the-Fly Propagator Generation\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-23219-5_22\"},{\"title\":\"dblp: Maria Garcia de la Banda\",\"url\":\"https://dblp.uni-trier.de/pers/hd/b/Banda:Maria_Garcia_de_la\"},{\"title\":\"Core-Guided Model Reformulation\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-58475-7_26\"},{\"title\":\"[PDF] A Constraint Seeker: Finding and Ranking Global Constraints from Examples\",\"url\":\"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/A-Constraint-Seeker:-Finding-and-Ranking-Global-Beldiceanu-Simonis/cbc3d545a820389b5af41657e2f9bd53cb932f23\"},{\"title\":\"Learning Constraint Satisfaction Problems: An ILP Perspective\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-50137-6_5\"},{\"title\":\"A Graph Transformation-Based Engine for the Automated Exploration of Constraint Models\",\"url\":\"https://ouci.dntb.gov.ua/en/works/4baRxw57/\"}]\n\nI found the paper you're looking for! \"Globalizing Constraint Models\" is authored by Kevin Leo, Christopher Mears, Guido Tack, and Maria Garcia de la Banda, and it was published 